meta {
  name: 03_KeyRoleAndSubPartyFilters
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Scenario: The three include filters in their true, false and auto settings

    Given the daily leader lists authorized parties with key role parties included
    Then the firm's clients are part of the result
    When key role parties are excluded
    Then only the parties the user reaches personally are left
    And auto follows the user's own profile setting
    When subunits are excluded
    Then no party carries subunits
    When inactive parties are excluded
    Then no deleted party is returned

  `includeSubParties` and `includeInactiveParties` are read by the service and resolved
  from the user profile when set to auto, but the resolved value is never applied to the
  query. The false steps assert the documented behaviour and fail against the deployed
  API for that reason.
}
